PFC Current Focus — the traffic-lit quarterly set from 4-focus/_data/focus.ndjson:
Foundations, Active Pursuits (with landings), Currently Consuming.

Status marks are text, never emoji (e-ink has no emoji font):
GREEN = going, YELLOW = easing, RED = not happening, PARKED = parked. Spelled
out in caps, never punctuation — a legend that isn't on the screen is a legend
nobody has. Ordering stays impact/urgency-first (AA before AB) to mirror the
Trello list; colour is only the tiebreak.
